T*
() Tj
T*
(1. Overview) Tj
T*
(Nimbus is AetherCorp's document intelligence platform. It ingests PDFs, contracts, and) Tj
T*
(knowledge-base articles, then answers questions with citations.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(2. Editions) Tj
T*
(Starter: 5 seats, 10,000 pages per month, 7-day retention of traces.) Tj
T*
(Team: 50 seats, 200,000 pages per month, 90-day retention, SSO.) Tj
T*
(Enterprise: unlimited seats, private networking, dedicated retrieval cluster, 365-day) Tj
T*
(retention, custom retention legal hold.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(3. Key features) Tj
T*
(- Semantic search across PDF and HTML sources) Tj
T*
(- Agentic retrieval that rewrites follow-up questions) Tj
T*
(- Citation-backed answers) Tj
T*
(- Prompt library with versioned YAML prompts) Tj
T*
(- Evaluation workspace that reports faithfulness and latency) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(4. Nimbus Query Language) Tj
T*
(Users may prefix a question with site:contracts or site:policies to constrain retrieval.) Tj
T*
(The default collection is "global".) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(5. Limits) Tj
T*
(Maximum upload size is 50 MB per file. Supported types are PDF, DOCX, and HTML. Images) Tj
T*
(inside PDFs are OCR'd when the OCR add-on is enabled.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(6. SLAs) Tj
T*
(Team edition monthly uptime target is 99.5%. Enterprise uptime target is 99.9%. P1) Tj
T*
(incidents are acknowledged within 15 minutes for Enterprise customers.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(7. Pricing) Tj
T*
(Starter is 49 USD per user per month. Team is 129 USD per user per month. Enterprise) Tj
T*
(pricing is quoted by sales@aethercorp.example.) Tj
T*
